      "@type": "skos:ConceptScheme",
      "notation": "grade-recommendation-strength",
      "prefLabel": "Recommendation strength (GRADE, as WHO applies it)",
      "definition": "The strength of a recommendation in a guideline developed with the GRADE approach, as the WHO handbook for guideline development applies it: how confident the guideline group is that the desirable effects of following the recommendation outweigh the undesirable ones. Named by a `recommendation` block's `strength` (bean 55ao).",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://iris.who.int/handle/10665/145714"
      },
      "changeNote": "WHO handbook for guideline development, 2nd edition (2014); ingested in the WHO IRIS library as `9789241548960-eng`. Owner ruling 2026-09-23 (bean 55ao, Q2): strength names a concept in a declared scheme, and each domain brings its own."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-repin-core-phw-fhir-iris/folio-assistant-core/folio-assistant-core-code-lists.jsonld#grade-recommendation-strength/strong",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "inScheme": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-repin-core-phw-fhir-iris/folio-assistant-core/folio-assistant-core-code-lists.jsonld#grade-recommendation-strength",
      "notation": "strong",
      "prefLabel": "Strong recommendation",
      "definition": "The guideline group is confident that the desirable effects of adherence outweigh the undesirable effects; most people in the situation would want the recommended course of action."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-repin-core-phw-fhir-iris/folio-assistant-core/folio-assistant-core-code-lists.jsonld#grade-recommendation-strength/conditional",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "inScheme": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-repin-core-phw-fhir-iris/folio-assistant-core/folio-assistant-core-code-lists.jsonld#grade-recommendation-strength",
      "notation": "conditional",
      "prefLabel": "Conditional recommendation",
      "definition": "The guideline group concludes that the desirable effects of adherence probably outweigh the undesirable effects, but is less confident; the choice depends on values, preferences and setting. Earlier editions called this a weak recommendation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/STAGING/claude-repin-core-phw-fhir-iris/folio-assistant-core/folio-assistant-core-code-lists.jsonld#rfc2119-requirement-level",
